# T_SCRE: the notes of a service record opened in the memo editor from
# the record form being edited, their request answered "-ERR 400" (the
# session has expired): the message, then the editor, the form and the
# list left for the login, after which the next command, the location
# list, runs.
K ENTER CTRL-E PGDN F4
S EXPIRED
K ENTER
S LOCS
K ESC
